{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 19, :comments ["<b>And these are the generations of Yitzchak.</b> Yaakov and Esav, as told in the parashah." "<b>Avraham begot Yitzchak.</b> Since Scripture wrote ״Yitzchak son of Avraham,״ it was necessary to say ״Avraham begot Yitzchak״ — because the scoffers of the generation were saying that Sarah conceived from Avimelekh, since she had been with Avraham all those years and did not conceive from him. What did the Holy One, blessed be He, do? He shaped Yitzchak's features to resemble Avraham, and all testified ״Avraham begot Yitzchak.״ And this is why it is written here ״Yitzchak son of Avraham״ — for there is testimony that Avraham begot Yitzchak."], :book :genesis, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 25, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:00:27.084867981Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}